      "title": "Note: Model links",
      "properties": {
        "text": "# Core direct wiring / Core直接接続\n\nUse this preserved template for standard character sheets with supplemental same_character references. Dedicated reference roles (face, footwear, clothing, etc.) require the separate Sheet Encode template.\n\nIMPORTANT: Core direct wiring does not execute reference_plan or reference_regions. Designer may omit a source for the selected view; its image tags can then point to different images in Core. Do not set dedicated roles on this wiring.\n\nこのテンプレートは標準キャラクターシートの同一人物の補足参照用です。部位専用参照・範囲指定・詳細ビューの参照選別には、別のSheet Encode対応テンプレートを使ってください。直接配線はreference_planを適用せず、画像番号がずれる場合があります。\n\nCharacter → Designer.character_image and Core image_2; extras 1/2/3 → corresponding Designer inputs and Core image_3/4/5; layout → Core image_1. Guide OFF supplies None. Width/height → EmptyLatentImage. Sampling and PNG saving are unchanged."
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Core direct wiring / Core直接接続\n\nUse this preserved template for standard character sheets with supplemental same_character references. Dedicated reference roles (face, footwear, clothing, etc.) require the separate Sheet Encode template.\n\nIMPORTANT: Core direct wiring does not execute reference_plan or reference_regions. Designer may omit a source for the selected view; its image tags can then point to different images in Core. Do not set dedicated roles on this wiring.\n\nこのテンプレートは標準キャラクターシートの同一人物の補足参照用です。部位専用参照・範囲指定・詳細ビューの参照選別には、別のSheet Encode対応テンプレートを使ってください。直接配線はreference_planを適用せず、画像番号がずれる場合があります。\n\nCharacter → Designer.character_image and Core image_2; extras 1/2/3 → corresponding Designer inputs and Core image_3/4/5; layout → Core image_1. Guide OFF supplies None. Width/height → EmptyLatentImage. Sampling and PNG saving are unchanged."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Multi Reference wiring\n\nCharacter LoadImage → Designer.character_image AND Encoder.images.image_2.\nExtra 1 → Designer.reference_image_1 AND Encoder.images.image_3.\nExtra 2 → Designer.reference_image_2 AND Encoder.images.image_4 (works without extra 1).\nDesigner.layout_image → Encoder.images.image_1. OFF returns None and compacts Qwen image tags.\nKeep each pair of connections synchronized when removing a reference.\nSet additional roles in Part directives. Guide images constrain arrangement only.\nDesigner width/height → EmptyLatentImage → KSampler, not the Encoder latent output.\nDefault: five views, Auto 1120, layout OFF, 30 steps / CFG 1 / Euler / simple."
      },
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    },
